#: package/emortal/luci-app-offload-switch/htdocs/luci-static/resources/view/offload/overview.js:199
msgid "Accelerators enabled where safe"
msgstr "在安全前提下启用各加速引擎"

#: package/emortal/luci-app-offload-switch/htdocs/luci-static/resources/view/offload/overview.js:72
msgid "Active"
msgstr "已启用"

#: package/emortal/luci-app-offload-switch/htdocs/luci-static/resources/view/offload/overview.js:147
msgid ""
"Active engines forward established traffic outside the normal CPU path. That "
"is what makes the router fast, and also what makes per-host accounting under-"
"report."
msgstr ""
"已启用的加速引擎会绕过常规 CPU 路径转发已建立的流量。这既让路由器更快，也会导"
"致按主机统计流量时少计。"

#: package/emortal/luci-app-offload-switch/htdocs/luci-static/resources/view/offload/overview.js:191
msgid "All accelerators stopped"
msgstr "停止全部加速引擎"

#: package/emortal/luci-app-offload-switch/htdocs/luci-static/resources/view/offload/overview.js:335
msgid "Applied:"
msgstr "已应用："

#: package/emortal/luci-app-offload-switch/htdocs/luci-static/resources/view/offload/overview.js:291
msgid "Apply %s"
msgstr "应用%s"

#: package/emortal/luci-app-offload-switch/htdocs/luci-static/resources/view/offload/overview.js:290
msgid "Apply (no change)"
msgstr "应用（无更改）"

#: package/emortal/luci-app-offload-switch/htdocs/luci-static/resources/view/offload/overview.js:327
#: package/emortal/luci-app-offload-switch/htdocs/luci-static/resources/view/offload/overview.js:349
msgid "Apply failed: %s"
msgstr "应用失败：%s"

#: package/emortal/luci-app-offload-switch/htdocs/luci-static/resources/view/offload/overview.js:268
msgid "Apply method"
msgstr "应用方式"

#: package/emortal/luci-app-offload-switch/htdocs/luci-static/resources/view/offload/overview.js:318
msgid "Applying…"
msgstr "正在应用…"

#: package/emortal/luci-app-offload-switch/htdocs/luci-static/resources/view/offload/overview.js:279
msgid ""
"Changes are applied at runtime — services are started/stopped and the "
"firewall is reloaded. Existing accelerated connections may linger, so "
"accounting can stay inaccurate until those connections expire or the device "
"reboots."
msgstr ""
"更改会在运行时生效——启动/停止相关服务并重载防火墙。已加速的连接可能会残留，因"
"此在它们过期或设备重启之前，流量统计可能仍不准确。"

#: package/emortal/luci-app-offload-switch/htdocs/luci-static/resources/view/offload/overview.js:205
msgid "Choose a goal"
msgstr "选择目标"

#: package/emortal/luci-app-offload-switch/htdocs/luci-static/resources/view/offload/overview.js:81
msgid "Controllable"
msgstr "可控"

#: package/emortal/luci-app-offload-switch/htdocs/luci-static/resources/view/offload/overview.js:134
msgid "Current goal"
msgstr "当前目标"

#: package/emortal/luci-app-offload-switch/htdocs/luci-static/resources/view/offload/overview.js:145
msgid "Detected acceleration engines"
msgstr "检测到的加速引擎"

#: package/emortal/luci-app-offload-switch/htdocs/luci-static/resources/view/offload/overview.js:138
msgid "Disabled"
msgstr "已禁用"

#: package/emortal/luci-app-offload-switch/htdocs/luci-static/resources/view/offload/overview.js:138
msgid "Enabled"
msgstr "已启用"

#: package/emortal/luci-app-offload-switch/htdocs/luci-static/resources/view/offload/overview.js:189
msgid "Everything off — see every packet."
msgstr "全部关闭——统计每一个数据包。"

#: package/emortal/luci-app-offload-switch/htdocs/luci-static/resources/view/offload/overview.js:197
msgid "Everything on — fastest routing."
msgstr "全部开启——最快的转发性能。"

#: package/emortal/luci-app-offload-switch/htdocs/luci-static/resources/view/offload/overview.js:223
msgid ""
"Existing connections may be interrupted briefly while the switch happens."
msgstr "切换过程中现有连接可能会短暂中断。"

#: package/emortal/luci-app-offload-switch/htdocs/luci-static/resources/view/offload/overview.js:248
msgid ""
"Flowtable offload can make inbound FullCone mapping inconsistent, so it "
"stays disabled in this mode. Hardware acceleration (NSS/ECM) is unaffected. "
"To also enable flowtable offload, disable FullCone NAT first."
msgstr ""
"flowtable 卸载可能导致入站 FullCone 映射不一致，因此该模式下保持关闭。硬件加"
"速（NSS/ECM）不受影响。如需同时启用 flowtable 卸载，请先关闭 FullCone NAT。"

#: package/emortal/luci-app-offload-switch/htdocs/luci-static/resources/view/offload/overview.js:235
msgid "Flowtable offload is enabled (software + hardware)."
msgstr "flowtable 卸载已启用（软件 + 硬件）。"

#: package/emortal/luci-app-offload-switch/htdocs/luci-static/resources/view/offload/overview.js:234
msgid ""
"Flowtable offload is kept off because FullCone NAT is enabled (see note "
"below)."
msgstr "由于已启用 FullCone NAT，flowtable 卸载保持关闭（见下方说明）。"

#: package/emortal/luci-app-offload-switch/htdocs/luci-static/resources/view/offload/overview.js:138
msgid "FullCone NAT"
msgstr "FullCone NAT"

#: package/emortal/luci-app-offload-switch/htdocs/luci-static/resources/view/offload/overview.js:247
msgid "FullCone NAT is enabled."
msgstr "已启用 FullCone NAT。"

