#: package/emortal/luci-app-offload-switch/htdocs/luci-static/resources/view/offload/overview.js:150
msgid ""
"No hardware accelerator was detected; only the software network path is used."
msgstr "未检测到硬件加速引擎；仅使用软件网络转发路径。"

#: package/emortal/luci-app-offload-switch/htdocs/luci-static/resources/view/offload/overview.js:254
msgid "Note on the firewall page."
msgstr "关于防火墙页面的说明。"

