msgstr "已关闭"

#: package/emortal/luci-app-offload-switch/htdocs/luci-static/resources/view/offload/overview.js:274
msgid ""
"Only a reboot fully clears residual accelerated flows and applies the module "
"front-end selection. It costs one short disconnection."
msgstr ""
"只有重启才能完全清除残留的加速流并应用模块前端选择。代价是一次短暂断网。"

#: package/emortal/luci-app-offload-switch/htdocs/luci-static/resources/view/offload/overview.js:201
msgid "Per-host accounting may under-report"
msgstr "按主机统计可能少计"

#: package/emortal/luci-app-offload-switch/htdocs/luci-static/resources/view/offload/overview.js:222
msgid "Per-host accounting tools (nlbwmon) and conntrack see every packet."
msgstr "按主机统计工具（nlbwmon）和 conntrack 可看到每个数据包。"

