#: package/emortal/luci-app-offload-switch/htdocs/luci-static/resources/view/offload/overview.js:119
msgid ""
"Switch every traffic accelerator on or off in one place: choose accurate per-"
"host statistics or maximum routing throughput. The platform and its "
"accelerators are detected automatically."
msgstr ""
"在一处统一切换所有流量加速引擎的开关：在精确的按主机统计与最高转发性能之间取"
"舍。平台及其加速引擎会自动检测。"

#: package/emortal/luci-app-offload-switch/htdocs/luci-static/resources/view/offload/overview.js:137
msgid "Target"
msgstr "目标平台"

#: package/emortal/luci-app-offload-switch/htdocs/luci-static/resources/view/offload/overview.js:237
msgid "The Qualcomm NSS/ECM engine is started for hardware acceleration."
msgstr "Qualcomm NSS/ECM 引擎已启动以进行硬件加速。"

#: package/emortal/luci-app-offload-switch/htdocs/luci-static/resources/view/offload/overview.js:220
msgid ""
"The Qualcomm NSS/ECM engine is stopped; accelerated flows are flushed and "
"the module unloaded."
msgstr "Qualcomm NSS/ECM 引擎已停止；加速流被清除且模块已卸载。"

#: package/emortal/luci-app-offload-switch/htdocs/luci-static/resources/view/offload/overview.js:255
msgid ""
"The firewall page forces flowtable offload off whenever its form is saved, "
"which will undo this setting. Re-apply this page afterwards if that happens."
msgstr ""
"防火墙页面在任何一次表单保存时都会强制关闭 flowtable 卸载，这会撤销此处的设"
"置。如发生这种情况，请在本页面重新应用。"

#: package/emortal/luci-app-offload-switch/htdocs/luci-static/resources/view/offload/overview.js:242
msgid "This is the normal operating mode for everyday use."
msgstr "这是日常使用的常规运行模式。"

#: package/emortal/luci-app-offload-switch/htdocs/luci-static/resources/view/offload/overview.js:239
msgid ""
"Throughput rises and CPU load drops, but per-host accounting may under-"
"report."
msgstr "吞吐量提升、CPU 负载下降，但按主机统计可能少计。"

